## About

This repository contains a learning project that implements a simplified Zerodha-like trading platform. It is intended for educational use to demonstrate:

- Building a full-stack MERN application
- JWT-based authentication and protected API routes
- State management in a trading dashboard using React Context
- Basic order placement and holdings management

This project is NOT affiliated with or endorsed by Zerodha.

