## Features

- 🔐 User registration and login with JWT
- 📊 Trading Dashboard — overview of portfolio, holdings, and P&L
- 🛒 Place Buy / Sell orders and view order history
- 💼 Track holdings and open positions
- 🌐 Responsive landing and dashboard UI
- ⚙️ Role for future expansions: WebSocket/live price feed, order matching, and charting

---

## Tech Stack

- Frontend: React, React Router, Axios, CSS
- Dashboard: React + Context API
- Backend: Node.js, Express
- Database: MongoDB (Mongoose)
- Auth: JWT (JSON Web Tokens)

---

## Project Structure

```
ZERODHA-PROJECT/
├── backend/          # Node.js + Express REST API server
│   ├── models/       # Mongoose schemas (User, Order, Holding)
│   ├── routes/       # API route handlers
│   ├── middleware/   # Auth middleware (JWT verification)
│   └── index.js      # Server entry point
│
├── dashboard/        # React trading dashboard app
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/   # Holdings, Positions, Funds, Orders
│   │   └── context/      # Context API for state management
│   └── package.json
│
├── frontend/         # React landing/marketing page
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/   # Navbar, Hero, Signup, etc.
│   └── package.json
│
└── README            # Project documentation (this file)
```

